  "statement": "# Pixel Platformer — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nRead compact single-screen pixel-art rooms, execute precise movement, collect optional rewards on riskier routes, and clear every room.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA short room-based 2D precision platformer with run/jump traversal, moving or interactive obstacles, fast failure recovery, and full-game completion.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose room topology, exact movement tuning, hazard combinations, optional pickups, and theme assignments from the supplied palette.\n"
